OL,3,GNEWSAAt risk in-person postpartum mums'
OL,4,Agroups saved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mothers' support service has said it
OL,7,Fis "absolutely thrilled" after it
OL,8,Freceived #70,000 worth of grants to
OL,9,Fmaintain its in-person wellbeing
OL,10,Fgroups.
OL,12,FThe Happy Mums Foundation, which
OL,13,Fsupports women experiencing postpartum
OL,14,Fmental health challenges, was set up in
OL,15,F2015 and has helped more than 1,000
OL,16,Ffamilies across Cumbria.
OL,18,FLast month the organisation said its
OL,19,Fin-person peer support groups were at
OL,20,Frisk due to funding pressures.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
